### 멱등 재요청 -> 200 + Idempotency-Replayed: true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallet/withdrawal-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: E2E-WDR-01

{"bankAccountId": 2, "amount": 300000}

### 같은 키 다른 금액 -> 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallet/withdrawal-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: E2E-WDR-01

{"bankAccountId": 2, "amount": 100000}

### 타인 계좌 -> 403 BANK_ACCOUNT_FORBIDDEN (계좌1은 사장 소유)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallet/withdrawal-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: E2E-WDR-02

{"bankAccountId": 1, "amount": 10000}